\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nRichelle dropped off her 3-year-old daughter to her mother today to attend a work meeting. She specifically reminded her mother not to spoil her daughter too much. When she went to pick her daughter up from her mother, she saw that her daughter was eating chocolate, while happily smiling and her face and hands covered in chocolate.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Richelle ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Embarrassment & Anger\nB) Embarrassment & Love\nC) Remorse & Jealousy\nD) Anger & Love\nE) Sadness & Love\nF) Sadness & Jealousy\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Richelle feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) Her mother followed her specific instructions & She doesn't like chocolate\nB) She doesn't like chocolate & She saw the sight of her daughter happy and smiling\nC) She was angry at her mom for giving her daughter a large amount of chocolate & She forgot to buy some chocolate\nD) She was angry at her mom for giving her daughter a large amount of chocolate & She doesn't like chocolate\nE) She was angry at her mom for giving her daughter a large amount of chocolate & She wanted to give her daughter chocolate herself\nF) She was angry at her mom for giving her daughter a large amount of chocolate & She saw the sight of her daughter happy and smiling","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00970847687544752,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7479aa9dc5a833d9dbb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484039383,"createTime"